From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:01:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 5317 hotfix: the contact enrichment queue gets its own table

enrichment_jobs was already the nightly enrichment job's table (010), so
242's CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS was skipped and every queue statement
failed on "column user_id does not exist": no saved contact has been
scored or enriched since 0355 went live, and the ticker started four
workers every five seconds into the same error (1,390 log lines in half
an hour).

- 243 creates contact_enrichment_jobs; the queue reads and writes only it.
- 242 is recorded as run; its body is now a no-op with the reason.
- After a worker stops on a queue error, no worker starts for 60 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
